When you teleport you fire a pulse that jolts enemies out of phase in a radius of [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] around both the start and the destination point.

Each target has a [4%, 6%, 8%, 10%, 12% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] chance per tile you travelled to be stunned, blinded, confused, or pinned for [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns.
